{"candidateAnswer":"Evan and Sam use physical activities, like running and gardening, as restorative tools to energize themselves and cope with boredom.","evidence":"[D21:18 | 4:25 pm on 26 December, 2023] Evan: \nThanks, Sam! I appreciate the compliment. This painting has such an inspiring vibe; you really have a knack for understanding art! How about you? How long have you been painting?\n[D21:22 | 4:25 pm on 26 December, 2023] Evan: Great idea, I think I'll do that as soon as I find it!\n[D11:15 | 8:57 pm on 6 October, 2023] Sam: Drawing is cool. I'm still just learning how to draw, but I love expressing myself through writing. It's therapeutic and helps me sort out my feelings. Though, I've been a bit frustrated lately with my new phone. Its navigation app keeps malfunctioning, making getting around a bit of a challenge.\n[D11:19 | 8:57 pm on 6 October, 2023] Sam: Thanks, Evan! It really helps me make sense of things and express my feelings. It's like having a conversation with myself.","itemId":"urn:uuid:cbefd22f-b658-5548-bf81-bfbc9b6257de","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:8969a935d2d3331c7b03437c3739c337a38a6342eb85e801b9229e200c526ed1","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How do Evan and Sam use creative outlets to cope with life's challenges?","referenceAnswer":"Evan and Sam use creative activities, like painting and writing, as therapeutic tools to express themselves and cope with stress.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"8969a935d2d3331c7b03437c3739c337a38a6342eb85e801b9229e200c526ed1"}}]}